N00B_DIAG(UNRESOLVED_NAME, "N00B-N0001", ERROR,
    "a name is used that is not declared in any visible scope",
    "Every name must be declared before it is used: as a local, a parameter,\n"
    "a declaration in this module, or a name brought in from another module.\n"
    "Check the spelling, or import the module that declares it:\n"
    "    import helper\n"
    "    let x = helper.compute(1)")
N00B_DIAG(AMBIGUOUS_MEMBER_NAME, "N00B-N0026", ERROR,
    "a bare name matches members of more than one enum or flagset",
    "Enum and flagset members can be used without their type's name, but\n"
    "only when one of the module's enums or flagsets has a member by that\n"
    "name. Write the type's name to say which one you mean:\n"
    "    let state = Phase.idle")
N00B_DIAG(UNKNOWN_TYPE, "N00B-N0002", ERROR,
    "a type name does not refer to any visible type",
    "Type annotations must name a built-in type, a type declared in this\n"
    "module, or a type exported by an imported module. Check the spelling,\n"
    "or import the module that declares the type:\n"
    "    let x: string = \"a\"")
N00B_DIAG(MODULE_MEMBER_MISSING, "N00B-N0003", ERROR,
    "a module does not declare the member that is used",
    "`module.name` looks up `name` among the declarations of `module`.\n"
    "The module has no declaration with that name. Check the spelling, or\n"
    "add the declaration to the module.")
N00B_DIAG(MODULE_MEMBER_PRIVATE, "N00B-N0004", ERROR,
    "a module member is used from a module that cannot see it",
    "A declaration marked `private` is visible only inside its own module,\n"
    "and a package shows other packages only what its manifest exports.\n"
    "Remove `private` from the declaration, export it from the package\n"
    "manifest, or use a visible declaration instead.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_MISSING, "N00B-N0005", ERROR,
    "a field is read from a record or object type that does not declare it",
    "`value.name` reads the field `name`, which the value's record or object\n"
    "type must declare:\n"
    "    record Point {\n"
    "        x: int\n"
    "    }\n"
    "    require p.x == 1\n"
    "Check the spelling against the type's fields.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_NOT_VISIBLE, "N00B-N0006", ERROR,
    "a private field or variant arm is used outside its module",
    "A `private` field is visible only inside the module that declares its\n"
    "type. Use a function of that module to read or change it, or remove\n"
    "`private` from the field.")
N00B_DIAG(VARIANT_CASE_NOT_ARM, "N00B-N0007", ERROR,
    "a `case` in a switch over a variant names something that is not an arm",
    "When a switch inspects a variant value, each `case` must name one of\n"
    "the variant's arms. Check the spelling against the arms the variant\n"
    "declares.")
N00B_DIAG(RESERVED_NAME, "N00B-N0008", ERROR,
    "a declaration uses a name reserved for the language",
    "Names that start with two underscores belong to the language: hooks\n"
    "such as `__init`, `__finalize` or `__cmp`, and built-in members such as\n"
    "`__value`. Declare a language hook with its exact name, or choose a\n"
    "name that does not start with `__`.")
N00B_DIAG(VALUE_USED_AS_TYPE, "N00B-N0009", ERROR,
    "a value is used where a type is required",
    "Type arguments and annotations must name types. A variable, constant\n"
    "or function cannot stand in for a type:\n"
    "    var items: List[int] = new[List[int]]()")
N00B_DIAG(OWN_PACKAGE_NAMESPACE, "N00B-N0010", ERROR,
    "a package refers to itself by its external namespace",
    "Code inside a package refers to its own modules by their internal\n"
    "module names. The external namespace is only for other packages.")
N00B_DIAG(TYPE_NAME_SHADOWED, "N00B-N0011", ERROR,
    "a declaration reuses the name of a visible type",
    "Type names cannot be shadowed, because a value with the name of a type\n"
    "would make annotations ambiguous. Choose another name.")
N00B_DIAG(LOCAL_HIDES_IMPORT, "N00B-N0012", ERROR,
    "a local declaration hides an imported declaration this use needs",
    "A local declaration takes precedence over a brought-in or prelude name,\n"
    "but here the local one cannot be used the way the code uses the name.\n"
    "Rename the local declaration, or use the imported one by its qualified\n"
    "path, such as `helper.name`.")
N00B_DIAG(AMBIGUOUS_NAME, "N00B-N0013", ERROR,
    "a name refers to declarations from more than one module",
    "Two or more modules in scope declare this name and nothing decides\n"
    "between them. Refer to the one you mean by its qualified path, or bring\n"
    "in only one of them.")
N00B_DIAG(BRING_CONFLICT, "N00B-N0014", ERROR,
    "a name brought in with `bring` conflicts with another name",
    "Each brought-in name must be unique in the module. Rename one of them:\n"
    "    bring circle as round_circle from shapes")
N00B_DIAG(BRING_MISSING, "N00B-N0015", ERROR,
    "a `bring` names something the module does not make visible",
    "`bring name from module` copies a visible declaration of `module` into\n"
    "this module's scope, and the module has no visible declaration with\n"
    "that name. To bring everything, write `bring all from module`.")
N00B_DIAG(MODULE_NAME_NOT_IMPORTED, "N00B-N0016", ERROR,
    "a module is referred to by a name that is not available here",
    "A module imported with `as` is referred to only by its new name, and a\n"
    "module whose names are only brought in with `bring` has no name of its\n"
    "own here. Use the alias, or add `import module`.")
N00B_DIAG(DUPLICATE_DEFINITION, "N00B-N0017", ERROR,
    "the same declaration is defined more than once",
    "A function with a given name and parameter types can be defined only\n"
    "once in a module. Remove one definition, rename it, or change its\n"
    "parameter types so it becomes a distinct overload.")
N00B_DIAG(OVERLAPPING_IMPORT, "N00B-N0018", WARNING,
    "a local function overlaps an imported function of the same name",
    "When both functions accept a call, the call binds to the local one.\n"
    "Rename the local function if the imported one was meant, or call the\n"
    "imported one by its qualified path.")
N00B_DIAG(UNUSED_FUNCTION, "N00B-N0019", WARNING,
    "a function is never called",
    "Nothing in the program calls this function, directly or through a\n"
    "trait, so it is dead code. Call it or delete it. `main`, `start`,\n"
    "`comptime_start`, native entry points and literal handlers are never\n"
    "reported.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_NEVER_SET, "N00B-N0020", WARNING,
    "a field is never given a value",
    "No code ever writes this field, so it always holds its default value.\n"
    "Set it where the value is built, or remove it.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_NEVER_READ, "N00B-N0021", WARNING,
    "a field is written but never read",
    "Values are stored in this field but nothing reads them. Read the field\n"
    "where it is needed, or remove it.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_NEVER_USED, "N00B-N0022", WARNING,
    "a field is never read or written",
    "Nothing in the program uses this field. Remove it.")
N00B_DIAG(UNUSED_TYPE, "N00B-N0023", WARNING,
    "a type is never used",
    "Nothing in the program names this type or makes a value of it. Remove\n"
    "it.")
N00B_DIAG(UNUSED_GLOBAL, "N00B-N0024", WARNING,
    "a module variable or constant is never used",
    "Nothing in the program reads or writes it. Remove it.")
N00B_DIAG(GLOBAL_NEVER_READ, "N00B-N0025", WARNING,
    "a module variable is written but never read",
    "Values are stored in this variable but nothing reads them. Read it\n"
    "where it is needed, or remove it.")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_TOO_MANY_ARGUMENTS, "N00B-T0001", ERROR,
    "a call passes more positional arguments than the function takes",
    "Positional arguments fill the function's positional parameters in\n"
    "order, and any extra ones go to its varargs parameter. Keyword\n"
    "parameters, the ones with a default value, are only passed by name.\n"
    "Remove the extra arguments, or pass them by name:\n"
    "    scale(2, factor = 3)")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_MISSING_ARGUMENT, "N00B-T0002", ERROR,
    "a call does not supply a required parameter",
    "Every positional parameter needs an argument, either all by position\n"
    "or all by name:\n"
    "    area(2, 3)\n"
    "    area(width = 2, height = 3)")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_MIXED_ARGUMENT_STYLES, "N00B-T0009", ERROR,
    "a call passes positional parameters both by position and by name",
    "A call supplies a function's positional parameters either all by\n"
    "position or all by name, not a mix of the two:\n"
    "    area(2, 3)\n"
    "    area(width = 2, height = 3)")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_VARARGS_BY_NAME, "N00B-T0020", ERROR,
    "a call passes the varargs parameter by name",
    "The varargs parameter collects the extra positional arguments of a\n"
    "call. It cannot be named; pass its items after the positional\n"
    "arguments:\n"
    "    total(1, 2, 3)")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_UNKNOWN_NAMED_ARGUMENT, "N00B-T0003", ERROR,
    "a named argument does not match any parameter of the function",
    "`name = value` in a call supplies the parameter called `name`, and the\n"
    "function has no parameter with that name. Check the spelling against\n"
    "the function's declaration.")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_ARGUMENT_REPEATED, "N00B-T0004", ERROR,
    "a call supplies the same parameter twice",
    "A parameter receives exactly one argument. Here it is supplied by\n"
    "position or by name and then again by name. Remove one of them.")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_ARGUMENT_TYPE, "N00B-T0005", ERROR,
    "an argument's type does not match its parameter's type",
    "Each argument must have, or convert to, the type its parameter\n"
    "declares. Convert the value before the call, or pass another value:\n"
    "    func twice(n: int) -> int\n"
    "    require twice(4) == 8")
N00B_DIAG(OVERLOAD_NO_MATCH, "N00B-T0011", ERROR,
    "no overload of a function accepts the arguments of a call",
    "Each overload was checked against the call's argument types and none\n"
    "accepted them. Compare the argument types with the candidate signatures\n"
    "listed with the error.")
N00B_DIAG(CONSUME_UNOWNED_PARAMETER, "N00B-T0015", ERROR,
    "a parameter the caller still owns is passed to a `consume` parameter",
    "A `consume` parameter takes ownership of its argument. An `in`,\n"
    "`view` or `modify` parameter does not own its value, so it cannot pass\n"
    "ownership on. Pass a copy, or declare the parameter `consume`.")
N00B_DIAG(NO_TRAIT_PROVIDES, "N00B-T0017", ERROR,
    "a dispatched call names something no trait of the value's type provides",
    "`value.name(...)` dispatches through the traits the value's type\n"
    "implements, and none of them provides `name`. Check the spelling, or\n"
    "implement a trait that provides it. Plain functions are called as\n"
    "`name(value)`.")
N00B_DIAG(GENERIC_MISSING_IMPLEMENTATION, "N00B-T0021", ERROR,
    "a generic function is used with a type that lacks a trait it needs",
    "A generic function can require traits of its type parameters, either\n"
    "in a `where` clause or by using a trait function in its body, such as\n"
    "`==` using `Equal.__equal`. A call that fills the type parameter with\n"
    "a type that does not implement that trait cannot work. Implement the\n"
    "trait for the type, or call a function that does not need it.")
N00B_DIAG(TRAIT_NOT_IMPLEMENTED, "N00B-T0018", ERROR,
    "an operation needs a trait that the value's type does not implement",
    "Operators, method calls and generic functions require their operand\n"
    "types to implement particular traits. Implement the trait for the type,\n"
    "or use a value of a type that implements it.")
N00B_DIAG(CONSTRUCTOR_NO_MATCH, "N00B-T0024", ERROR,
    "no `__init` of a type accepts the arguments of a construction",
    "Each visible `__init` of the type was checked against the arguments and\n"
    "none accepted them. Compare the arguments with the `__init` signatures.")
N00B_DIAG(TYPE_REFERENCE_CONFLICT, "N00B-T0039", ERROR,
    "a type name is used where a different type is required",
    "The type a name refers to does not fit the way the surrounding code\n"
    "uses it. Check that the annotation names the intended type.")
N00B_DIAG(CYCLIC_ALIAS, "N00B-T0040", ERROR,
    "a type alias is defined in terms of itself",
    "A transparent alias is another name for its target, so an alias whose\n"
    "target leads back to the alias names nothing. Break the cycle with a\n"
    "record, an object or a nominal alias.")
N00B_DIAG(TYPE_MISMATCH, "N00B-T0046", ERROR,
    "an expression's type does not match the type its context requires",
    "Each expression has one type, and every use of it must agree with that\n"
    "type. Convert the value, or change the annotation that disagrees.")
N00B_DIAG(NOT_CALLABLE, "N00B-T0047", ERROR,
    "a value that is not a function is called",
    "Only functions can be called with `(...)`. Check that the name refers\n"
    "to the function you meant and is not hidden by a variable.")
N00B_DIAG(TYPE_REQUIREMENT, "N00B-T0049", ERROR,
    "a value's type is not of the kind an operation requires",
    "Some operations accept only certain kinds of types, such as integers\n"
    "for bitwise operators. Convert the value to an accepted type.")